{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BIG LOOT</strong> -  is a roguelike caravan survival game about risk, loot, and smart trading.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a journey of hard choices, clever upgrades, and the eternal question:<br>Do I play it safe... or go for the BIG LOOT?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your wagon by crafting parts from gathered resources.</strong> Add extra crates to carry more loot or reinforce wheels to ensure delivery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116730/extras/6028493342b5e24fff1594c917f78807.poster.avif?t=1772204142\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116730/extras/6028493342b5e24fff1594c917f78807.webm?t=1772204142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116730/extras/6028493342b5e24fff1594c917f78807.mp4?t=1772204142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every journey is unique.</strong> Choose your route when leaving town: safe but modest, or dangerous but loot-rich.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116730/extras/e441ea7f325cf2c94643ace65cb54854.poster.avif?t=1772204142\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116730/extras/e441ea7f325cf2c94643ace65cb54854.webm?t=1772204142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116730/extras/e441ea7f325cf2c94643ace65cb54854.mp4?t=1772204142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pockets aren\u2019t stretchy, but your backpack is</strong>. It literally expands from loot. Better drop it before a fight... but be careful, unless you want your goods to roll away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116730/extras/8086594a86e436caccc288fcec2fecfc.poster.avif?t=1772204142\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116730/extras/8086594a86e436caccc288fcec2fecfc.webm?t=1772204142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116730/extras/8086594a86e436caccc288fcec2fecfc.mp4?t=1772204142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot and trade.</strong> Find valuable items, engage in trading, meet wandering traders, and improve relations with them to access rare goods.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116730/extras/83d917d1709853f9eb6e23b10bbbf864.poster.avif?t=1772204142\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116730/extras/83d917d1709853f9eb6e23b10bbbf864.webm?t=1772204142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116730/extras/83d917d1709853f9eb6e23b10bbbf864.mp4?t=1772204142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3116730?t=1772204142","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116730/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772204142","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116730/6e44cacd305e7f32d3d496483526efc326db3d97/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772204142","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116730/6e44cacd305e7f32d3d496483526efc326db3d97/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772204142","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"In the game, players can consume alcohol as an in-game item. Additionally, some characters may appear in their underwear"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BIG LOOT</strong> -  is a roguelike caravan survival game about risk, loot, and smart trading.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a journey of hard choices, clever upgrades, and the eternal question:<br>Do I play it safe... or go for the BIG LOOT?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your wagon by crafting parts from gathered resources.</strong> Add extra crates to carry more loot or reinforce wheels to ensure delivery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116730/extras/6028493342b5e24fff1594c917f78807.poster.avif?t=1772204142\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3116730/extras/6028493342b5e24fff1594c917f78807.webm?t=1772204142\" type=\"video/we